            "id": "2913b8fb-ef74-3f11-bbd0-49d141a45e5b",
            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "Cuprina Holdings obtains dealer license for IVF media production facility",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Cuprina Holdings (CUPR), on April 6, completed construction of, and obtained ISO 13485 certification and a dealer license for, an operational in-vitro fertilization media production facility in Singapore. The ISO 13485 certification, which validates that Cuprina\u2019s quality management system at the facility meets internationally agreed standards for medical device manufacturing, was issued by United Kingdom Accreditation Service, a part of the International Accreditation Forum. The dealer license,",
